      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Loxahatchee_Groves%2C_Florida",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1925, George Frederick Bensel opened a combined gas station, grocery store, and post office that still marks early commerce.",
